<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<odoo>

    <record id="view_infohub_source_form_llm" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">infohub.source.form.llm</field>
        <field name="model">infohub.source</field>
        <field name="inherit_id" ref="infohub.view_infohub_source_form" />
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <xpath expr="//group[@name='classification']" position="after">
                <group string="LLM 增强" name="llm">
                    <field name="llm_summarize" />
                    <field name="llm_translate_to" placeholder="留空不翻译，例如 中文" />
                    <field name="llm_classify" />
                    <field
                        name="llm_model_id"
                        invisible="not llm_summarize and not llm_translate_to and not llm_classify"
                    />
                    <div
                        class="alert alert-warning"
                        role="alert"
                        colspan="2"
                        invisible="not llm_summarize and not llm_translate_to and not llm_classify"
                    >
                        LLM 调用按量计费。条目量大的源开启前请先估算成本——一个每天 200 条的
                        源开启摘要，就是每天 200 次调用。
                    </div>
                    <div
                        class="alert alert-light"
                        role="alert"
                        colspan="2"
                        invisible="not llm_classify"
                    >
                        零样本归类只在来源**没有**受控分类码时才值得开。arXiv 这类有精确
                        编码的来源用映射表 classifier 又准又免费，不必开这个。
                    </div>
                </group>
            </xpath>
        </field>
    </record>

</odoo>
